  "caveats": [
    "Age structure is observed only through 2022 (ONEI 3.3); 2023-2026 is a cohort projection whose error grows with horizon and is carried as an explicit noise term.",
    "The 2019 baseline embeds no counterfactual improvement in Cuban mortality after 2019.",
    "Attributable deaths are an association with the crisis period, not a cause-of-death attribution; blackouts, arboviruses, drug shortages and delayed care are not separately identified.",
    "Registered deaths for 2026 are a scenario continuation (+4% on 2025).",
    "Dfac is shared with Model D, so this is not independent of the headcount."
  ]
